Oh, I dropped out.

785
00:52:49.812 --> 00:52:51.772
In my third year of medical school, yes.

786
00:52:57.111 --> 00:52:58.613
I should have come to you earlier.

787
00:52:58.696 --> 00:53:01.157
Oh, I'm really fine.

788
00:53:01.240 --> 00:53:02.742
There are a lot of things like this

789
