When working on civil affairs
It happens every day

790
00:53:06.454 --> 00:53:07.872
I was quite surprised when I got the call.

791
00:53:08.456 --> 00:53:10.458
I'm really fine

792
00:53:12.501 --> 00:53:13.419
Still

793
00:53:14.462 --> 00:53:15.838
It's worth it to do it once.

794
00:53:17.798 --> 00:53:19.550
Policeman P.
Because you contacted me at number 1.

795
00:53:22.845 --> 00:53:23.763
That's right

796
00:53:25.222 --> 00:53:26.933
But, that...

797
00:53:28.059 --> 00:53:29.977
To Baek Do-ha too
Shouldn’t we let you know?

798
00:53:31.437 --> 00:53:33.189
What are you doing? It's okay

799
00:53:34.607 --> 00:53:35.816
It's really no big deal

800
00:53:36.359 --> 00:53:37.777
And Director Baek Do-ha

801
00:53:38.486 --> 00:53:40.780
Because I am sensitive to accidents
It's definitely going to be seriously overdone.

802
00:53:43.324 --> 00:53:45.451
For something that is nothing
Because I’m going to make a fuss for no reason

803
00:53:46.118 --> 00:53:47.787
Attorney, don't say anything.

804
00:54:11.310 --> 00:54:13.396
I can't connect
After the beep...

805
00:54:13.479 --> 00:54:15.314
Ah...

806
00:54:21.278 --> 00:54:22.279
Ha...

807
00:54:36.752 --> 00:54:37.795
What is it?

808
00:54:41.674 --> 00:54:42.633
Kehem, um

809
00:54:43.426 --> 00:54:44.427
Yes, this is Baek Do-ha.

810
00:54:52.184 --> 00:54:53.144
Oh my

811
00:54:54.186 --> 00:54:56.272
Did you hear?
I don't know

812
00:54:56.355 --> 00:54:57.857
Song Ha-kyung is currently hospitalized.

813
00:54:58.899 --> 00:55:00.901
-Where is the hospital room?
- It's over there.

814
00:55:00.985 --> 00:55:03.279
I have an urgent schedule right now
Because I'm here

815
00:55:03.362 --> 00:55:04.238
If you don't mind

816
00:55:04.822 --> 00:55:06.949
Please take Song Ha-kyung to the hospital instead.
Can you please go?

817
00:55:07.616 --> 00:55:11.620
Because it's July 7th or something.
I heard there was a real uproar at the city hall, huh?

818
00:55:11.704 --> 00:55:13.581
No, people have nowhere to play

819
00:55:13.664 --> 00:55:16.959
Why did you come to a closed school?
Are you making a fuss over a romance? Mr.

820
00:55:17.043 --> 00:55:19.962
Bright young people
They came rushing in and took it, huh?

821
00:55:20.046 --> 00:55:21.380
Making a mess

822
00:55:22.673 --> 00:55:24.133
Even our chief officer

823
00:55:25.509 --> 00:55:28.429
Ha, in this case
Just designate it as a holiday.

824
00:55:28.512 --> 00:55:29.388
We need to get them out of town.

825
00:55:29.472 --> 00:55:30.639
But aren't you busy?

826
00:55:30.723 --> 00:55:31.682
Umm

827
00:55:40.107 --> 00:55:41.984
how do you
Aren't you going to tell me what happened to you?

828
00:55:42.735 --> 00:55:44.820
- Because it’s no big deal.
- Isn't it a big deal?

829
00:55:45.821 --> 00:55:47.281
On a subject that lasted 2 weeks and was hospitalized?

830
00:55:49.325 --> 00:55:51.535
Hey, Song Ha-kyung, do you have my number?

831
00:55:52.119 --> 00:55:53.204
Did you delete my number?

832
00:55:53.287 --> 00:55:55.915
Why didn't you call me, huh?

833
00:55:57.541 --> 00:55:58.751
Baekdoha

834
00:56:00.086 --> 00:56:01.629
Why am I calling you?

835
00:56:01.712 --> 00:56:03.130
There is Seo Soo-hyuk.

836
00:56:03.214 --> 00:56:04.215
Hey, Song Ha-kyung!

837
00:56:12.681 --> 00:56:14.100
Why are you so upset? Really

838
00:56:14.183 --> 00:56:16.435
Even though I was hospitalized
Ignoring all my contacts

839
00:56:16.519 --> 00:56:17.603
So what?

840
00:56:18.229 --> 00:56:20.272
why? Uproar?

841
00:56:22.149 --> 00:56:23.526
Don’t you think about worrying about people?

842
00:56:23.609 --> 00:56:24.693
I wonder if you’re like this

843
00:56:25.486 --> 00:56:27.279
I was going to be discharged tomorrow anyway.

844
00:56:27.905 --> 00:56:29.740
Just for something insignificant
People coming in and out

845
00:56:29.824 --> 00:56:30.950
It's because it's uncomfortable.

846
00:56:32.243 --> 00:56:34.995
- Hospitalization was just a formality.
- So why am I the only one who doesn’t know?

847
00:56:35.704 --> 00:56:38.874
Everyone in the world knows what you do
Why am I the only one who doesn’t know!

848
00:56:46.841 --> 00:56:47.842
Okay, stop.

849
00:56:48.843 --> 00:56:51.887
The situation has been resolved and it's not a big deal.
So stop

850
00:56:52.930 --> 00:56:54.140
Are you excluding me?

851
00:56:56.350 --> 00:56:58.644
In your daily life, in your life
Did you just decide to exclude me?

852
00:57:03.190 --> 00:57:05.317
I deliberately confirmed that it was so.
Are you doing this to give me something, now?

853
00:57:05.401 --> 00:57:07.194
I don't understand so I just don't understand
Because it seems like there is?

854
00:57:12.533 --> 00:57:13.492
Hey, Baek Do-ha

855
00:57:13.576 --> 00:57:15.661
You are everything I'm doing

856
00:57:15.744 --> 00:57:18.497
to show you
It feels like a play.

857
00:57:19.081 --> 00:57:20.416
Please don't overdo it

858
00:57:22.001 --> 00:57:25.546
Final argument?
That was already 2 years ago

859
00:57:26.297 --> 00:57:27.506
It's so distant to me

860
00:57:28.591 --> 00:57:30.759
Oh, it also happened two days ago
It's so thin

861
00:57:30.843 --> 00:57:33.262
I alone give meaning to what happened two years ago
Making a fuss

862
00:57:34.388 --> 00:57:35.473
Isn't it so funny?

863
00:57:36.640 --> 00:57:38.517
Because I think that's my truth
I see you like this

864
00:57:39.185 --> 00:57:42.188
I just did that
With one intention to win the trial

865
00:57:42.980 --> 00:57:45.566
Just know-how I picked up from around me
I hit them all

866
00:57:46.859 --> 00:57:47.776
Hey, Baek Do-ha

867
00:57:49.153 --> 00:57:50.404
Do you know what?

868
00:57:50.488 --> 00:57:52.031
when you come back

869
00:57:52.114 --> 00:57:54.825
Always my old self
Are you just talking about my past self?

870
00:58:01.790 --> 00:58:02.875
Hey, Song Ha-kyung

871
00:58:03.792 --> 00:58:05.628
You're making me a guest

872
00:58:07.546 --> 00:58:08.589
Now I'm making the past

873
00:58:10.716 --> 00:58:12.968
I'm afraid your box will be opened
Are you making your final struggle now?

874
00:58:43.958 --> 00:58:45.084
Ah

875
00:58:45.167 --> 00:58:46.460
hello

876
00:58:46.544 --> 00:58:48.462
- Song Ha-kyung?
- Yes

877
00:58:48.546 --> 00:58:49.797
I think you can be discharged today.

878
00:58:51.549 --> 00:58:53.759
Ah, actually, it's an effect

879
00:58:53.842 --> 00:58:57.638
I was a little worried about infection.
Ah, the progress is better than I expected.

880
00:58:57.721 --> 00:58:59.848
First aid too
You did very well in the beginning.

881
00:59:01.308 --> 00:59:03.143
Ha-kyung Song.
Please help me with discharge procedures

882
00:59:03.227 --> 00:59:04.061
yes

883
00:59:04.144 --> 00:59:05.813
You're making me a guest

884
00:59:06.730 --> 00:59:08.023
Now I'm making the past

885
00:59:08.774 --> 00:59:10.776
I'm afraid your box will be opened
Are you making your final struggle now?

886
00:59:11.485 --> 00:59:12.403
I'm sorry.

887
00:59:13.529 --> 00:59:16.782
I want to stay just one more day today
Can't I be discharged tomorrow?

888
00:59:59.783 --> 01:00:01.910
Please wait here for a moment.
I'll get the car right away.

889
01:00:01.994 --> 01:00:03.120
Yes, yes

890
01:00:19.053 --> 01:00:19.887
What is it?

891
01:00:21.555 --> 01:00:22.514
what are you doing?

892
01:00:24.642 --> 01:00:26.101
Baek Do-ha, what are you doing? Hey

893
01:00:47.748 --> 01:00:49.750
Hey, what are you doing? Stop right now

894
01:00:49.833 --> 01:00:51.251
I can't help but break down

895
01:00:52.294 --> 01:00:54.713
Listening to your sincerity at the peanut restaurant
It seems like I've gone overboard

896
01:00:55.422 --> 01:00:56.423
What?

897
01:00:57.841 --> 01:00:58.967
Are you fastening your seat belt tightly?

898
01:01:01.470 --> 01:01:02.971
We won't go home today

899
01:01:45.472 --> 01:01:47.599
{\an8}Let's be alone
tonight and all night

900
01:01:47.683 --> 01:01:48.976
{\an8}You're obsessed with this, huh?

901
01:01:49.059 --> 01:01:51.437
{\an8}If you tease me
I have to do it too, it's you and me

902
01:01:51.520 --> 01:01:53.772
{\an8}I can do what I can too
I have no choice but to do it all

903
01:01:53.856 --> 01:01:55.607
{\an8}Lawyer, lawyer!

904
01:01:55.691 --> 01:01:58.110
{\an8}- Hey, Baekdoha
- Song Ha-kyung

905
01:01:58.193 --> 01:01:59.862
{\an8}- Shall we go to the East Sea now?
- yes?

906
01:01:59.945 --> 01:02:01.238
{\an8}Then come to my house.

907
01:02:01.321 --> 01:02:02.740
{\an8}What? Are you inviting me home?

908
01:02:02.823 --> 01:02:04.158
{\an8}Have you eaten yet?

909
01:02:05.159 --> 01:02:08.454
{\an8} As for Song Ha-kyung, I
I have no intention of playing fair.

910
01:02:08.537 --> 01:02:10.497
{\an8}The film was cut off.

911
01:02:10.581 --> 01:02:13.083
{\an8}Ah, what about yesterday?
What happened?

912
01:02:13.167 --> 01:02:14.334
{\an8}Hey, Baekdoha

913
01:02:14.418 --> 01:02:15.794
{\an8}Uh, hey! hey!

914
01:02:15.878 --> 01:02:18.005
{\an8}- I guess I'm crazy
- Do you like that kind of guy?

915
01:02:18.088 --> 01:02:20.299
{\an8} Transparent, Song Ha-kyung is transparent

916
01:02:20.382 --> 01:02:21.675
{\an8}I liked it the whole time

917
01:02:21.759 --> 01:02:24.052
{\an8}It was like that in the past and it is still like that now.

918
01:02:24.595 --> 01:02:26.472
{\an8}I like you

